abstract: >-
  Ghonchu is the friendly tutor of Abhishek Choudhary's robotics course: Colab notebooks that run on a phone, from a child's
  first plastic robot to research in clinics, field archaeology, linguistics, psychology, brain-computer interfaces and CubeSats.
  Initial drop: the notebooks are extracted from the course's design discussion and are not yet run end to end.
